This product bundles third-party software. In particular, the report engine
vendors a minified Apache ECharts build (tracebi/reports/assets/echarts.min.js,
Apache ECharts 6.1.0, built with esbuild from echarts + zrender + tslib) and
INLINES it into every generated report .html. Each generated report is
therefore a redistribution of that bundle, and this NOTICE — with the
attributions below — must travel with it.

A report that embeds its data as Parquet (a large-detail artifact) additionally
inlines the client-side worker engine — tracebi/reports/assets/
tracebi-engine.worker.js and parquet_wasm_bg.wasm.gz — which bundles
parquet-wasm, Arquero, and Apache Arrow (JS). Such a report is a redistribution
of those as well; see the per-file detail and rebuild instructions in
tracebi/reports/assets/ENGINE_NOTICE.md, and the attributions below.

